SUMMARY:In Conversation: Laurent Grasso
LOCATION:Mass MoCA\, 1040 Mass MoCA Way\, North Adams\, MA 01247
DESCRIPTION:Metaphysical Maze\nConceived as a journey\, Laurent Grasso’s 
 exhibition immerses visitors in a contemplative state that expands their p
 erception of time with film\, paintings\, and architectural interventions.
  Together\, these presentations will bring past and present into conversat
 ion\, placing Grasso’s work in a dialogue with historical figures of Ame
 rican landscape painting.\nhttps://massmoca.org/event/in-conversation-laur
 ent-grasso/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://massmoca.org/event/in-conversation-laurent-grasso/
END:VEVENT
